2.Set the ith bit:
N=N&(1<<i);

3. Toggle the ith bit:
N=N^(1<<i);

4.Clear the ith bit:
N=N&~(1<<i);
or using 
N=N&^(1<<i);

5.Last set bit:
N&(N-1);

